mos6_nocap off (80 C, m=3), sat (vgs=1.5, vds=3.0, vbs=-0.5), acg
load "spice/mos6.osdi"
model vs vsource
model nm sp_mos6 type=1 vto=0.7 kv=2 nv=0.8 kc=5e-5 nc=1.2 lambda0=0.02 lambda1=0.01 gamma=0.5 gamma1=0.1 sigma=0.01 phi=0.7
vd (d 0) vs dc=3.0
vg (g 0) vs dc=1.5 mag=1
vb (b 0) vs dc=-0.5
m1 (d g 0 b) nm w=10u l=2u ad=20p as=20p pd=24u ps=24u $mfactor=3
control
  options temp=80 tnom=27 reltol=1e-9 abstol=1e-15 rawfile="ascii"
  analysis ac1 ac from=1e9 to=1e9 mode="lin" points=1
endc
